{"nodes": [{"id": "schema_v1_token_authentication", "label": "Token Based Authentication", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "API callers must be Django users with an associated API Token and send Authorization: Token <hex> on each request. The literal prefix Token is required, separated by whitespace from the token value."}, {"id": "schema_v1_pagination", "label": "API List Pagination", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All list results are paginated with a default page size of 100 because some queries are very costly, especially for models with many rows. Clients follow next/previous URLs or pass limit to change page size."}, {"id": "schema_v1_tokenauth", "label": "tokenAuth", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "schema_v1_classifier", "label": "Classifier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "schema_v1_project", "label": "Project", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "machine_name is unique and read-only; it must be the slugified Sphinx conf.py project value."}, {"id": "schema_v1_version", "label": "Version", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Users can get, list, and delete Version objects but cannot create or update them the normal Django way; new versions enter via tarball import. archived versions are excluded from search indexes."}, {"id": "schema_v1_sphinxpage", "label": "SphinxPage", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pages are read-only in the API because they should be updated in the source Sphinx project, not the database. Derived fields have interdependencies that must be accounted for while editing. orig_* fields are retained so body and TOCs can be reprocessed later. body is stored as a Django template."}, {"id": "schema_v1_sphinximage", "label": "SphinxImage", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Images are purposely read-only because they are dependent objects of SphinxPage instances and should not be updated independently."}, {"id": "schema_v1_projectrelatedlink", "label": "ProjectRelatedLink", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "schema_v1_versionupload", "label": "VersionUpload", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Import work is done in VersionUploadView. The tarball is uploaded to a temporary directory that disappears at the end of the view. Submit multipart form-data with a single file key named file."}, {"id": "schema_v1_versionuploadview", "label": "VersionUploadView", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "schema_v1_version_import", "label": "POST /api/v1/version/import/", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "schema/v1.yml", "source_loca